config BR2_PACKAGE_DELUGE_ALSA_STATIC
	bool "deluge-alsa-static"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	help
	  A static-only second build of alsa-lib whose libasound.a is installed
	  into the staging sysroot ONLY (never the target rootfs). It lets the SDK
	  statically link libasound into apps, which run from the SD card and must
	  not depend on any particular image's rootfs.

	  Buildroot's alsa-lib builds shared OR static, not both (its configure.ac
	  refuses "static and shared libraries together"), and every rootfs needs
	  the shared libasound.so — so this provides the .a alongside it. Headers,
	  alsa.pc and /usr/share/alsa come from the shared alsa-lib package.
